OL,3,GNEWSAHousehold waste collections could
OL,4,Abe cut in Wirral
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen bins for general household waste
OL,7,Fcould be emptied every three weeks
OL,8,Finstead of every fortnight under plans
OL,9,Fbeing considered by Wirral Council.
OL,11,FThe council said the proposal would
OL,12,Faffect about 142,000 households and
OL,13,Fcould save around #1.2m a year in
OL,14,Fcollection costs.
OL,16,FIt said weekly food waste collections
OL,17,Fhad reduced the amount of rubbish being
OL,18,Fplaced in green bins, which are used
OL,19,Ffor waste that cannot be recycled.
